{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7671294026435856667","title":"天线测试工程师","description":"1.负责手机、平板硬件测试开发及验证工作,负责测试方案设计、测试用例研究、测试标准制定；\n2.搭建测试环境或平台,完善并执行测试方案以满足产品标准和质量需求,输出测试报告；\n3.开发或选取合理的测试设备与系统,以实施测试方案,分析并提出优化改善建议；\n4.协助建设内部试验室测试能力,并能对测试问题进行定位分析,提出优化改善建议；\n5.外部测试试验室资源的选择和管理。","requirement":"1. 天线、通信、电子信息、自动化相关专业硕士及以上,211和985优先；\n2.对天线和射频模块有一定了解,对测试工作感兴趣；\n3.结果导向,自我驱动,具备良好的自学能力；\n4.具有良好的沟通能力,团队协作意愿和能力；\n5.英语四级及以上水平,具备良好的读写能力；\n6.熟练使用office等办公软件；\n7. 了解常用射频仪器的使用,频谱分析仪.信号源等； ","city_info":{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","i18n_name":"南京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786112541798,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7467761529010634860","name":"测试类","en_name":"Testing","i18n_name":"测试类"},"job_id":"7671294026435725595","city_list":[{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"南京","py_name":"nanjing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000121","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"南京","py_name":"nanjing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000121"